# Wispdrinker Vampire: "{5}{W}{B}: Creatures you control with power 2 or less gain deathtouch and lifelink until end of turn." On turn 5 Bot1 has Wispdrinker (power 2), Hill Giant
# (power 3) and, after the ability resolves, a Memnite. Wispdrinker gets both abilities, the Hill Giant does not (power 3), a creature of Bot2's does not, and the
# Memnite that enters afterwards does not. Wispdrinker's lifelink shows in combat (Bot1 gains 2). The effect is gone on turn 6.

